  "body": "Information Pack: https://vltre.co/TQNNcH\r\n\r\nMore Privacy. More Outdoor Space. More Reasons to Love Coming Home.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Lot 4 at 14 Kiri Place, Mairangi Bay - the final home in this exclusive collection of just four brand-new residences.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the rear of the development, Lot 4 offers an appealing sense of privacy, complemented by a lovely backyard and additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a modern home with a little more breathing room and a more private setting, this could be the one.\r\n\r\nSpace to Live. Room to Enjoy.\r\n\r\n*  Four generously proportioned bedrooms\r\n*  Two stylish, fully tiled bathrooms\r\n*  Additional guest toilet downstairs\r\n*  Single internal-access garage\r\n*  Additional off-street parking space\r\n*  Lovely backyard with outdoor space to enjoy\r\n*  Designer kitchen with premium appliances and elegant stone benchtops\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n*  Outdoor decking for relaxing and entertaining\r\n\r\nModern Comforts & Quality Finishes\r\n\r\n*  Freehold title - no body corporate fees\r\n*  Underfloor heating for year-round comfort\r\n*  Contemporary designer bathrooms\r\n*  Feature lighting\r\n*  Air conditioning in the living area and master bedroom\r\n*  Modern architectural design\r\n*  Thoughtfully designed interiors\r\n\r\nRangitoto College Zone\r\n\r\nEnjoy the advantage of being within the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone - an attractive feature for families planning their future on the North Shore.\r\n\r\nA Location That Connects You\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Constellation Drive motorway connections, shopping centres, cafés, restaurants, everyday amenities and beautiful North Shore beaches.\r\n\r\nThe Privacy of a Rear Home. The Convenience of Extra Parking. The Comfort of Brand-New Living.\r\n\r\nWith only four homes in this exclusive development, Lot 4 offers a particularly appealing combination of privacy, outdoor space and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to secure this special home at 14 Kiri Place!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Property Guru, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or The WORX Real Estate / Real Estate Brokers Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
